valid             ok 3 61e4b8adf09f9880
a real efbfbd     ok 1 efbfbd
80                err at 0
61 ff 62          err at 1
c0 af             err at 0
e0 80 af          err at 0
ed a0 80          err at 0
ed 9f bf (valid)  ok 1 ed9fbf
